WEBVTT

00:04.200 --> 00:07.500
Young General Zu, pardon my presumption.

00:08.680 --> 00:14.200
Father, how about this: why not call this duel a contest for my hand in marriage?

00:12.880 --> 00:20.500
Zu Yue! You conduct yourself like an untamed outlaw! In the presence of His Highness, where is your decorum?!

00:22.440 --> 00:25.000
His Majesty arrives!
